        "svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1080 470\" width=\"1080\" height=\"470\" font-family=\"'Malgun Gothic','맑은 고딕','Apple SD Gothic Neo',sans-serif\"><style>\n     .dg-node { fill: var(--panel); stroke-width: 1.2; }\n     .dg-node-text { fill: var(--text); font-size: 11px; }\n     .dg-sub { fill: var(--text-faint); font-size: 10px; }\n     .dg-title { fill: var(--text); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; }\n     .dg-edge { fill: none; stroke: var(--border-strong); stroke-width: 1.1; }\n     .dg-edge-strong { fill: none; stroke: var(--accent); stroke-width: 1.6; }\n     .dg-band { fill: var(--panel-alt); stroke: var(--border); }\n     .dg-chip { fill: var(--panel); stroke: var(--border); }\n     .dg-chip-text { fill: var(--text-soft); font-size: 10.5px; }\n   </style><defs>\n     <marker id=\"dg-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n       <path d=\"M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z\" fill=\"var(--border-strong)\" />\n     </marker>\n     <marker id=\"dg-arrow-accent\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n       <path d=\"M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z\" fill=\"var(--accent)\" />\n     </marker>\n   </defs><text class=\"dg-title\" x=\"30\" y=\"30\">한 벌의 소스 → 세 가지 실행 형태</text><rect class=\"dg-node\" x=\"30\" y=\"56\" width=\"220\" height=\"118\" rx=\"11\" stroke=\"#2f5fd0\" /><text class=\"dg-node-text\" x=\"46\" y=\"80\" font-weight=\"600\" font-size=\"12\">src/js/*.js (67개)</text><text class=\"dg-sub\" x=\"46\" y=\"100\">scripts.manifest.json 순서</text><text class=\"dg-sub\" x=\"46\" y=\"118\">src/styles.css</text><text class=\"dg-sub\" x=\"46\" y=\"136\">vendor/*.js (23개)</text><text class=\"dg-sub\" x=\"46\" y=\"154\">manneung-classroom.html</text><rect class=\"dg-node\" x=\"320\" y=\"86\" width=\"180\" height=\"58\" rx=\"11\" stroke=\"#7a5cd0\" /><text class=\"dg-node-text\" x=\"336\" y=\"110\" font-weight=\"600\" font-size=\"12\">build-offline.js</text><text class=\"dg-sub\" x=\"336\" y=\"130\">npm run build</text><rect class=\"dg-node\" x=\"320\" y=\"172\" width=\"180\" height=\"58\" rx=\"11\" stroke=\"#7a5cd0\" /><text class=\"dg-node-text\" x=\"336\" y=\"196\" font-weight=\"600\" font-size=\"12\">desktop/build.bat</text><text class=\"dg-sub\" x=\"336\" y=\"216\">launcher.cs → exe</text><path class=\"dg-edge-strong\" d=\"M 250 115 L 310 115\" marker-end=\"url(#dg-arrow-accent)\" /><path class=\"dg-edge-strong\" d=\"M 250 130 C 285 130, 285 200, 310 200\" marker-end=\"url(#dg-arrow-accent)\" /><rect class=\"dg-node\" x=\"570\" y=\"46\" width=\"480\" height=\"116\" rx=\"11\" stroke=\"#12805c\" /><text class=\"dg-node-text\" x=\"590\" y=\"70\" font-weight=\"600\" font-size=\"12\">① manneung-classroom.html — 온라인 HTML</text><text class=\"dg-sub\" x=\"590\" y=\"92\">vendor 를 CDN 에서 받는 원본. 첫 실행에 인터넷 필요.</text><text class=\"dg-sub\" x=\"590\" y=\"112\">브라우저 샌드박스 안에서만 동작 — File System Access 로 원본 저장.</text><text class=\"dg-sub\" x=\"590\" y=\"132\">로컬 Python·PowerPoint 연동 없음, Pyodide 만 사용.</text><text class=\"dg-sub\" x=\"590\" y=\"150\">개발 중 기준 파일이자 check-source.js 의 검사 대상.</text><rect class=\"dg-node\" x=\"570\" y=\"176\" width=\"480\" height=\"116\" rx=\"11\" stroke=\"#12805c\" /><text class=\"dg-node-text\" x=\"590\" y=\"200\" font-weight=\"600\" font-size=\"12\">② manneung-classroom-offline.html — 단일 파일</text><text class=\"dg-sub\" x=\"590\" y=\"222\">HTML·CSS·로컬 JS·vendor 를 한 파일로 인라인(19.1MB).</text><text class=\"dg-sub\" x=\"590\" y=\"242\">지연 vendor 는 text/plain 블록으로 넣고 MNLazy 가 꺼내 쓴다.</text><text class=\"dg-sub\" x=\"590\" y=\"262\">인터넷 없이 열기·편집 가능. Pyodide 최초 실행만 예외.</text><text class=\"dg-sub\" x=\"590\" y=\"280\">check-release.js 가 로컬 경로 잔존·해시를 검사.</text><rect class=\"dg-node\" x=\"570\" y=\"306\" width=\"480\" height=\"136\" rx=\"11\" stroke=\"#c0392f\" /><text class=\"dg-node-text\" x=\"590\" y=\"330\" font-weight=\"600\" font-size=\"12\">③ manneung-classroom.exe — 로컬 서버 동반</text><text class=\"dg-sub\" x=\"590\" y=\"352\">launcher.cs 가 127.0.0.1 고정 포트(17645→…)로 바인딩.</text><text class=\"dg-sub\" x=\"590\" y=\"372\">오프라인 HTML 을 품은 19.3MB 실행 파일이 브라우저를 자동으로 연다.</text><text class=\"dg-sub\" x=\"590\" y=\"392\">추가로 열리는 것: 실제 디스크 저장, 로컬 Python·pip·커널,</text><text class=\"dg-sub\" x=\"590\" y=\"412\">PowerPoint 정확 변환, ffmpeg 미디어 변환, SQLite, 시험지 수신.</text><text class=\"dg-sub\" x=\"590\" y=\"430\">모든 위험 엔드포인트는 실행별 X-Manneung-Token 을 요구.</text><path class=\"dg-edge\" d=\"M 500 108 C 535 108, 535 104, 560 104\" marker-end=\"url(#dg-arrow)\" /><path class=\"dg-edge\" d=\"M 500 122 C 535 122, 535 234, 560 234\" marker-end=\"url(#dg-arrow)\" /><path class=\"dg-edge\" d=\"M 500 201 C 535 201, 535 374, 560 374\" marker-end=\"url(#dg-arrow)\" /></svg>",
